      "攻撃の避け方",
    ],
    [
      4,
      Buffer [FF FF FF FF],
    ],
    [
      "languages",
      {
        "en": "How to Avoid Attacks",
        "es": "Esquivar ataques",
        "fr": "Éviter les attaques",
        "jp": "攻撃の避け方",
        "ko": "공격을 피하는 방법",
        "zh-TW": "攻擊的閃避方式",
      },
      "5",
    ],
    [
      12,
      Buffer [01 00 00 00 CF 00 00 00 00 00 00 00],
    ],
    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "<cmd CMD_UNIT_JUMP>　<c t_cmd>Jump</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_STEP>　<c t_cmd>Dash</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_GUARD>　<c t_cmd>Guard</c>
<space>
Defeat the incoming enemies while avoiding their attacks.",
        "es": "<cmd CMD_UNIT_JUMP> <c t_cmd>Salto</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_STEP> <c t_cmd>Esquivar</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_GUARD> <c t_cmd>Guardia</c>
<space>
Esquiva los ataques enemigos y derrota a los que se acerquen.",
        "fr": "<cmd CMD_UNIT_JUMP> : <c t_cmd>Saut</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_STEP> : <c t_cmd>Esquive</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_GUARD> : <c t_cmd>Garde</c>
<space>
Évitez les attaques des ennemis et éliminez-les.",
        "jp": "<cmd CMD_UNIT_JUMP>　<c t_cmd>ジャンプ</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_STEP>　<c t_cmd>ステップ移動</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_GUARD>　<c t_cmd>ガード</c>
<space>
敵の攻撃を避けつつ、迫りくる敵を倒しましょう。",
        "ko": "<cmd CMD_UNIT_JUMP>　<c t_cmd>점프</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_STEP>　<c t_cmd>스텝 이동</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_GUARD>　<c t_cmd>가드</c>
<space>
적의 공격을 피하면서 다가오는 적을 쓰러뜨립시다.",
        "zh-TW": "<cmd CMD_UNIT_JUMP>　<c t_cmd>跳躍</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_STEP>　<c t_cmd>墊步移動</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_GUARD>　<c t_cmd>防禦</c>
<space>
邊閃避敵人的攻擊，邊打倒襲來的敵人吧。",
      },
      "6.0",
      5,
    ],
