        "en": "Repeatedly press <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_1> to execute a combo. During a combo,
press <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_2> to perform a Spinning Slash that is enhanced
depending on the length of the combo.
