      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "Hold <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_1> or <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_2> to build power, then release to fire an arrow.
<space>
After shooting an arrow, press <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_1> or <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_2> with the right timing
to fire off a second shot with the same built-up power.
This is called a <c t_notice>Critical Draw</c>.",
        "es": "Mantén <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_1> y <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_2> para cargar. Suelta para disparar.
