      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "<cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_1>　<c t_cmd>Magic Shot</c>
<cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_2>　<c t_cmd>Conjure Magic Bomb</c>
<space>
A weapon that allows you to use different elemental magic
attacks. The element of the basic attacks vary per staff.",
        "es": "<cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_1> <c t_cmd>Disparar balas mágicas</c>
