Press <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_2> to create a magic bomb and set it down. Its blast radius
and power differs based on the number of magic shots.",
        "es": "Mantén <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_1> para fijar y suelta para disparar balas
mágicas al objetivo.
