    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "(Bows only)
Hold down <cmd CMD_UNIT_GUARD> while charging and move <cmd CMD_UNIT_MOVE_STICK> around to <c t_cmd>aim</c>.
Then release <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_1> or <cmd CMD_UNIT_ACTION_ATTACK_2> to <c t_cmd>shoot arrows. Take aim at your foes
and fire a shot where the reticle is targeting.
",
        "es": "(Solo arco)
Pulsa <cmd CMD_UNIT_GUARD> y <cmd CMD_UNIT_MOVE_STICK> <c t_cmd>Control de mirilla</c>
