    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "Even if you lose mid-challenge, your item level will still be
updated (if applicable), and you will bring back any EXP or items
you acquired. So don't fear failure, and be sure to give the Item
World a try whenever you like.
",
        "es": "No obstante, aun si te derrotan, el nivel de objeto se verá
reflejado y conservarás la experiencia y objetos obtenidos.
