      {
        "en": "<c t_cmd>System/Give Up</c>
End your current exploration of the Chara World and <c t_notice>return to
the Overlord's Castle</c>. You will keep any rewards you've earned.

",
        "es": "<c t_cmd>[Sistema - Rendirse]</c>
Abandonarás Mundo personaje y <c t_notice>volverás al castillo</c>.
Obtendrás los resultados de tu exploración.

",
        "fr": "<c t_cmd>Système – Abandonner</c>
