    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "These are the <c t_notice>Special Skills</c> N.A. currently has access to.
<space>
The Special Skills N.A. can use change based on the type of
weapon he has equipped. Use <cmd CMD_CHARACTER_ACT> to change or swap your
