      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "You can reincarnate a Buddy into a different rank or even a
whole different kind of monster. Since each type of monster
can learn different Evilities, reincarnating them into all sorts
of things will make them a more well-rounded combatant.
",
        "es": "Los familiares pueden reencarnarse a una especie diferente.
<space>
