    [
      8,
      Buffer [EA 00 00 00 00 00 00 00],
    ],
    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "Various <c t_notice>events</c> can occur depending on which tile you land on
each turn. The type of event you get will determine which of
N.A.'s stats is enhanced. Rest assured that, although there's
an element of randomness, N.A's stats will overall rise as a
result of exploring the Chara World.",
        "es": "En cada casilla ocurre un <c t_notice>evento</c> diferente. Y las mejoras
varían dependiendo de dicho evento.
<space>
Pero no te preocupes, no serás más débil que antes de entrar
a Mundo personaje.",
        "fr": "Des <c t_notice>événements</c> se déclenchent en fonction des cases
sur lesquelles vous vous arrêtez.
